### V34 Changes vs V33d

**C3 — Gap filter tightened (−1.5% → −1.0%):**
Skips entries where the next-day open gaps down 1.0–1.5% vs prior close. Those fills were slightly adverse. Trade count dropped only ~18 trades/year (1.6%). Tested standalone in V38a: +$324k equity, +0.55% CAGR, MaxDD improved. As permanent C3 baseline in V39a: +$413k, +0.68% CAGR, MaxDD −52.57%.

**C5 — Tiered signal sizing (top 20% get 1.2× size):**
On days with 5+ entry candidates, the top 20% by composite score (RSI2/ATR_pct) receive a 1.2× position size multiplier. Hard cap of 12% per position. Zero change to trade count or win rate. Tested on C3 baseline in V39a: +$337k additional equity, +0.51% CAGR. MaxDD −54.50% (vs −52.57% baseline) — acceptable tradeoff for a taxable account.

**Combined V34 gain vs V33d: +$750k final equity, +1.19% CAGR.**

